---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Contact Dave for Website Help | Mantis Digital Media
description: Contact Dave Carrano at Mantis Digital Media for website repairs, new websites, SEO, custom graphics, and creative digital services. Call or text 203-402-9550.
---

<section class="section-one-column">
  <div class="section-inner-container form-section">

    <h1 class="reveal">Tell Me What You Need Help With</h1>

    <p class="reveal">
      Hi, I’m Dave Carrano. I help small businesses repair, improve, build,
      and creatively customize their websites.
    </p>

    <p class="reveal">
      You may need one small website update, a complete new website, better
      Google visibility, custom graphics, or an idea that does not fit neatly
      into a standard package.
    </p>

    <p class="reveal">
      Tell me what you are trying to accomplish, and I’ll personally review
      your request and respond with clear next steps.
    </p>

    <p class="reveal">
      Small projects are welcome. The initial consultation is free and there
      is no obligation.
    </p>

    <p class="reveal">
      Fastest way to reach me:
      <strong>Call or text 203-402-9550</strong>
    </p>

    <h2 class="reveal">Contact Dave</h2>

    <p class="reveal">
      Fill out the form below and include any details that will help me
      understand your website, business, or project.
    </p>

  </div>
</section>



<section class="main-contact-form-container">

  <form
    class="main-contact-form js-form-reveal"
    name="contact"
    method="POST"
    data-netlify="true"
    data-netlify-honeypot="bot-field"
    action="/contact/success/"
    netlify
  >

    <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="contact" />

    <p style="display:none;">
      <label>
        Don’t fill this out if you’re human:
        <input name="bot-field" />
      </label>
    </p>

    <div class="js-form-field">
      <label for="fullName">Full Name *</label><br>

      <input
        id="fullName"
        name="fullName"
        type="text"
        autocomplete="name"
        required
      />
    </div>

    <div class="js-form-field">
      <label for="businessName">Business Name</label><br>

      <input
        id="businessName"
        name="businessName"
        type="text"
        autocomplete="organization"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="js-form-field">
      <label for="serviceArea">Town or Service Area</label><br>

      <input
        id="serviceArea"
        name="serviceArea"
        type="text"
        placeholder="Example: Shelton, CT"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="js-form-field">
      <label for="email">Email Address *</label><br>

      <input
        id="email"
        name="email"
        type="email"
        autocomplete="email"
        required
      />
    </div>

    <div class="js-form-field">
      <label for="phone">Phone Number</label><br>

      <input
        id="phone"
        name="phone"
        type="tel"
        autocomplete="tel"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="js-form-field">
      <label for="website">Current Website URL</label><br>

      <input
        id="website"
        name="website"
        type="url"
        placeholder="https://example.com"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="js-form-field">
      <label for="help">What do you need help with? *</label><br>

      <select id="help" name="help" required>

        <option value="" selected disabled>
          Select one
        </option>

        <option value="Free Website Review">
          Free Website Review
        </option>

        <option value="Website Tune-Up">
          Website Tune-Up — $100
        </option>

        <option value="Website Repairs or Updates">
          Website Repairs or Updates
        </option>

        <option value="New Website">
          Build a New Website
        </option>

        <option value="Website Redesign">
          Redesign My Existing Website
        </option>

        <option value="SEO">
          Improve My Google Visibility
        </option>

        <option value="Monthly Website and SEO Support">
          Monthly Website and SEO Support
        </option>

        <option value="Custom Graphics or Illustration">
          Custom Graphics or Illustration
        </option>

        <option value="Animation or Creative Website Feature">
          Animation or Creative Website Feature
        </option>

        <option value="Flyer or Promotional Design">
          Flyer or Promotional Design
        </option>

        <option value="Other Idea">
          I Have Another Idea
        </option>

        <option value="Not Sure">
          I’m Not Sure What I Need
        </option>

      </select>
    </div>

    <div class="js-form-field">
      <label for="contactMethod">Preferred Contact Method</label><br>

      <select id="contactMethod" name="contactMethod">
        <option value="Text">Text</option>
        <option value="Phone">Phone</option>
        <option value="Email">Email</option>
      </select>
    </div>

    <div class="js-form-field">
      <label for="message">Tell Me About Your Project *</label><br>

      <textarea
        id="message"
        name="message"
        rows="7"
        required
        placeholder="Tell me about your business, your website, the problem you are having, or the idea you would like to discuss."
      ></textarea>
    </div>

    <div class="js-form-field">
      <button class="cta1" type="submit">
        Send Message
      </button>
    </div>

  </form>

</section>



<section class="section-one-column">
  <div class="section-inner-container">

    <h2 class="reveal">Work Directly With Me</h2>

    <p class="reveal">
      Mantis Digital Media is my personal web design and creative services
      business. You will communicate directly with me throughout your project.
    </p>

    <p class="reveal">
      I’m based in Shelton, Connecticut, and work with small businesses
      throughout Connecticut and remotely across the United States.
    </p>

    <p class="reveal">
      Local service areas include Shelton, Milford, Stratford, Monroe,
      Trumbull, New Haven, Stamford, and surrounding communities.
    </p>

  </div>
</section>



